window.products.push({"id":936164,"name":"VEVOR Electric Bread Cutting Machine, 31 PCS Slices with 12mm Thickness, 304 Stainless Steel Commercial Toast Bread Slicer with Adjustable Inlet & Out","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":624.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PvodO8TNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"key Features304 Stainless Steel MaterialThe premium 304 stainless steel contributes to this bread slicer's rust & corrosion resistance and durability, allowing your slicer machine to stand up to the rigors of constant use.Powerful Copper MotorThe 370-watt high-power pure-copper motor ensures quick and efficient bread slicing, which will shorten the waiting time and improve production. It also provides you with a low-noise and energy-saving operation.Adjustable Inlet BaffleBy adjusting the knobs mounted at the inlet, you can slice the bread with the width of 110 mm-390 mm, perfectly meeting your slicing demands.Sharp BladesThis commercial bread slicer adopts a set of stainless steel blades, creating a smooth slicing process. It is able to cut 31pcs bread at one time with 12 mm thickness.Effortless to OperateThe adjustable outlet can catch the bread slices properly. The top knob helps fix your bread during the operation process. The nonslip feet improve the stability of this machine. Two handles on the side are convenient for you to transport. Besides, we also offer you 2 extra blades for replacement.Wide ApplicationsThis bread slicer is ideal for home and commercial use, such as kitchens, bakeries, restaurants, coffee shops, etc. In addition to slicing bread, you can also use it to cut toasts, cucumbers, hams, and tomatoes.SpecificationsModel: YB-31Material: 304 Stainless SteelColor: SilverSlice Thickness: 0.47 inch /12 mmSlice Number: 31 PiecesWidth Of The Bread: 4.3-15.4 inch / 110-390 mmItem Dimension: 23.2 x 23.2 x 26.7 inch / 59 x 59 x 68 cmItem Weight: 143.3 lbs / 65 kgPackage Content1 x Commercial Toast Bread Slicer2 x Blades","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PvodO8TNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B0B4DC5XC2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4DC5XC2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4DC5XC2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
