window.products.push({"id":936308,"name":"3 in 1 Wine Corkscrew Opener, Ultra Smooth Twisting, Built-in Beer Bottle Opener with Magnetic Cap Catcher, Premium Stainless Steel Screw, Easy Storag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dNYQKfFFS._AC_.jpg","description":"✔ 【 The Ultra Smooth Twisting You won't Miss 】The coating on the screw determines the smoothness of drilling the cork. Compared with China-made non-stick painting that is widely used, Greblon Hydro-painting is the top-grade painting which provides ultra smooth opening experience while the wearing ability is enhanced remarkably as well ✔ 【 Exceptional Anti-rust Ability】Instead of using 65Mn, Our screw is made of premium 420J2 stainless steel, which ensures longer durability and stronger corrosion resistance ✔ 【 Easy to Operate 】 With self-pulling mechanism which is the same as electric wine bottle opener and ultra sharp screw, just twist the handle clockwise continuously to pull the cork out. Then twist the handle count-clockwise to get the cork off from the screw. No jerking, pulling, levers or bottle-twisting required. Never worried about destroying the cork ✔ 【 Multi-function Tool 】Beer Opener with build-in magnetic cap catcher: The bottle opener opens pop-top beer and soda bottles with ease. Foil Cutter: Perfectly removes wine bottle foil quick and easy before uncorking. Wine Opener: This wine bottle opener will lift the plug in a moment’s notice, giving aromas the chance to escape ✔ 【90-day Guarantee】 Please be noticed that we provide 90-day guarantee on all of our products. Within 90 days after items received, if there is any problem with the items (quality, function, etc.), please contact us. We’re confident with the quality and function. If you’re not happy with it, just send it back","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dNYQKfFFS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KITCHENDAO","source_asin":"B094WZL82J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094WZL82J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094WZL82J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
