window.products.push({"id":936348,"name":"Handmade Brass Lord Ganesha Wall Hanging Puja Idol with 3 Diyas and Bells","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IyM7wYxsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lord Ganesha is one of the most important figures in the Hindu religion. As the remover of obstacles, he is often called upon to help people overcome seemingly insurmountable odds and deal with problems that arise in daily life. Whether you're a practicing Hindu or simply want to enhance your decor with exotic Indian artwork, the ShalinIndia Handmade Brass Lord Ganesha Wall Hanging Puja Idol is a stunning addition to the look of every room and a celebration of the greatness of Ganesha.Designed to be mounted to a wall, the ShalinIndia Handmade Brass Lord Ganesha Wall Hanging Puja Idol shows Ganesha in all of his glory. The highly detailed face of the elephant-headed god is lifelike and simply breathtaking to behold. Attached to the trunk of the ShalinIndia Handmade Brass Lord Ganesha Wall Hanging Puja Idol are three deep dishes that can be used as oil lamps or diyas. To do so, simply fill with ghee or vegetable oil, add a cotton wick and light. Dangling from each of the bowls is a handcrafted bell that can be used for worship or simply enjoyed as a decoration.In homes, the ShalinIndia Handmade Brass Lord Ganesha Wall Hanging Puja Idol can be utilized for offerings, lit as a Diwali decoration or simply enjoyed as a work of art. The wall hanging is handcrafted using sand casting techniques by brassworkers from North India, making it a piece of home decor that can last through many generations and become a true family heirloom. The wall hanging measures 9.5 inches from top to bottom and is 4 inches wide at its largest point.Bring the beauty of oil lamps and the rich color of brass to your decor! Order the ShalinIndia Handmade Brass Lord Ganesha Wall Hanging Puja Idol now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IyM7wYxsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shalinindia","source_asin":"B00YN4H1H4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YN4H1H4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YN4H1H4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":936349,"name":"The Observers by Master's Art, 35x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":133.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ngEhIKmuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an abstract composition. Masters Fine Art is a company that travels around the world to bring the best in fine art from outstanding artists from different lands. They believe that art is the sould of the world, that it represents our human essence.MFA works mostly with Latin American art. It portrays a happy view of life, represented with bright beautiful colors, music, dance, love, hope and happiness, giving us the feeling that we can overcome all hardships with all the beautiful things we still have in life. The art Masters FineArt carries is many things: colorful, contemporary, sexy, emotional, musical, romantic.Above all it is beautiful and full of joy. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece.The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame.This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ngEhIKmuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00GSPJ46C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GSPJ46C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GSPJ46C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
