window.products.push({"id":936439,"name":"Moss Pole Plant Stake for Indoor Monstera 2 Pack 15 Inches, Coir Totem Pole Plant Support for Climbing Potted Plants","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cEcLdGAoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Moss Pole Plant Support?  1. Moisture Retention - the climbing plants are able to get moisture from the coco coir efficiently.  2. Grow Support - train your plant to grow upwards without mess.  3. User Friendlily - sharpened wood stick can be put into the soil easily.  4. Fast Installation - ready-to-install design, just take few simple steps to use it. 5. Extendable Design - without limitation to support plants in its grow stages.  6. Natural Material - provide a natural environment to plants for growing.  7. Useful Setup Kit - 78’’ Hook and Loop Strips comes with the moss poles, it provides more flexibility for you to secure plants to the coir moss pole, also you can take it off easily and reuse them as garden ties.  8. High Quality Plant Tags - great for indoor plant labeling 9. Wide Application - Good partner for monstera, creepers, pothos, climbing plants, money plant, and other indoor plants. Application - 4 Simple Steps 1. Peel-off the PVC protective film. 2. Insert the wood stake into the soil and close to the plant’s stem.  3. Use hook and loop strips to secure the plants to the moss pole.  4. Use the secondary moss pole to make extension when it’s necessary. Package Includes: 2 x 15’’ Coir Totem Pole 1 x 78’’ Hook and Loop Strip 10 x plant tag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cEcLdGAoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UoYeet","source_asin":"B08YNDNBD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YNDNBD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YNDNBD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
