window.products.push({"id":936514,"name":"Sggvecsy Christmas Gnome Plush with Led Light 2Pack Christmas Decorations Handmade Swedish Tomte Elf Doll Lighting Scandinavian Santa Gnome Ornaments ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D6PYX5iAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIAL DESIGN: We put classic elements of Christmas into the gnomes by color and design,such as the warm glowing LED light,(Required 3 AA batteries, not included), snowflake patterns, star on the top hat,fiber fur beard and fabric nose.The color with grey and red combination is full of Christmas atmosphere, easy to create a chic of holiday touch. Add this adorable Xmas gnome for a bright and colorful compliment to your winter time centerpieces. PACKAGE & SUITABLE SIZE: You will get 2 pieces of Christmas decorations with different colors. Inside the gnome hat is adjustable iron wire, the gnome hat is bend to fix the box. Please expand the hat and adjust into original shape. The total height is approx 13inch, the width is about 7 inch which is a proper size to fit any place and big enough to catch everybody's eyes! PREMIUM MATERIAL: These handmade Swedish tomte elfs are made of soft fiber fur, fabric nose and knit, which is durable and stable with soft comfortable touch. At the bottom of the gnome is the switch button on/off, able to use several festival seasons. IDEAL GIFT CHOICE: The lighting Scandinavian Santa gnome ornaments are great gift for Christmas decoration,it’s regarded as good luck and the brings good luck to families. We can easily take this lucky to our best friends, children, lover, parents. Can also be used as collectible housewarming gifts. WIDELY APPLICATION: The handmade Swedish tomte elfs are adorable additions for you to decorate your home and room, like bookshelf, table, sofa, bed cabinets,bookcase, shelf and dining table for Christmas, New Year, Winter, Thanksgiving, Birthdays, holiday, festival decoration. Children like the appearance mostly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D6PYX5iAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sggvecsy","source_asin":"B0BFQN8W6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFQN8W6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFQN8W6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
