window.products.push({"id":936525,"name":"Nogent Classic Double-Edge Vegetable Peeler, Dark Wood Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31OVThCsyTL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Nogent factory was founded in 1923 in the Champagne village of Biesles France - an area steeped in history where the tradition of manufacturing knives has been carried out since the middle ages. All production steps are quality controlled by long-term and experienced personnel which guarantees very reliable products designed for longevity and a lifetime of use. 42 successive operations in ten different workshops are required to produce a knife or kitchen utensil worthy of the Nogent name. Nogent Classic Cutlery is found in kitchens all over France, a traditional design which has been tried and tested for three generations. The hand finished, satin-finish blade is molybdenum stainless steel, containing 0.50-percent carbon, 15-percent chrome and Molybdenum. The blade has a Rockwell hardness of 56-58. An extra strong tang is securely held in the handle with aluminum rivets. The warm and comfortable-to-the-touch handle is made of solid natural hornbeam wood, dried for one year at the factory before processing. All the wood used in production comes from managed sustainable sources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31OVThCsyTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nogent","source_asin":"B00405S6QG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00405S6QG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00405S6QG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
