window.products.push({"id":936564,"name":"Grasslands Road Angel with Heart Figurine, 10-Inch, Gift Boxed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7115xkV033L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wish, dream and believe that angels do exist. Angel holding a Heart stands 10 Inch tall featuring antiqued hammered vine leaf wings with acrylic teardrop beads. Body of angel is made out of cement blended with resin to enhance the sculpted details of cement texture. Great décor for indoor or outside under cover not exposed to extreme elements. Metal wings including acrylic beads can be detached for easier storage and gift packaging. Angel is gift boxed in Kraft paper box. Beautifully detailed and carefully crafted angel is an important addition to any home whether to remind, comfort, or inspire. Check out other charming angel in Grasslands Road collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7115xkV033L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grasslands Road","source_asin":"B00C77VI3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C77VI3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C77VI3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":936565,"name":"Wusthof Classic Deluxe 8-Piece Block Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DHC1GK2PL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Classic cutlery line bears all the traits that W?sthof knives are known for: impeccable construction, incredible sharpness, and long-lasting durability. Each Classic knife is precision-forged--blade, bolster, and tang--from a single piece of high-carbon, stain-resistant steel. The blade is tested by lasers and honed by hand, with computer-controlled front-to-back tapering, grinding, and polishing. A visible full tang--the bladeÆs shaft runs the entire length of the handle--ensures excellent balance and strength. Classic handles are molded from a durable black synthetic called Hostaform-C with traditional triple riveting. The knives promise a lifetime of hard-working companionship in the kitchen. This W?sthof Classic 8 piece block set is a great way to jumpstart your cutlery collection or begin overhauling your old set of knives. Designed to meet the most popular cutting demands, the set includes an 8\" Cooks knife for chopping, and a 3-1/2-inch paring knife for coring, trimming, and peeling, 4.5\" Utility knife for spreading and slicing. This sets also includes a 8\" bread knife, 6\" sandwich knife, kitchen shears. Wusthof also includes a 9-inch sharpening steel and an attractive oak block with a total of 17 slots so you can add specialty knives or your old favorites. Classic knives, though safe in the dishwasher, should be washed by hand for best results Amazon.com This eight-piece set completes the cutlery needs for the average kitchen but is intended to be a starter set for chefs planning on acquiring some additional specialty knives. Providing excellent control for average-sized hands, the 8-inch cooks knife performs the majority of the chopping and mincing tasks in the kitchen. The 6-inch sandwich knife is a staple for halving a sandwich or trimming meat while the 8-inch serrated bread knife cuts through a crusty loaf with ease. The 4-1/2-inch utility knife will become a well-loved tool for smaller cutting tasks, such as slicing garlic or fruit. Finally, the 3-1/2-inch paring knife is perfect for peeling apples or hulling strawberries. A 9-inch sharpening steel keeps knife edges sharp and a pair of kitchen shears cuts herbs, poultry, or packaging. The 17-slot oak block holds all knives with room to spare for six steak knives and five other knives. Part of Wüsthofs popular Classic line of cutlery, these knives have a very traditional design. Blades are hand-forged from a single piece of high-carbon steel so they retain their sharp edges longer and are easier to resharpen, plus they include a stain-resistant alloy. Blades are also ground and polished by computer to ensure perfect tapering from tip to bolster. A signature feature of Wusthof knives, the weighted bolster gives these knives the perfect heft. For balance, full tangs extend through the synthetic handles and are triple-riveted for strength. --Cristina Vaamonde Whats in the Box 8-inch cooks knife, 8-inch bread knife, 6-inch sandwich knife, 4-1/2-inch utility knife, 3-1/2-inch paring knife, 9-inch sharpening steel, kitchen shears, 17-slot oak block.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DHC1GK2PL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B00029QUX0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00029QUX0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00029QUX0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
