window.products.push({"id":936682,"name":"Duluth Forge Ventless Propane Gas Log Set - 24 in. Split Red Oak 33,000 BTU, Manual Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s5q36V3rL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Duluth Forge’s Ventless Propane Gas Log Sets offer an amazing heating alternative for your family, in that they allow you to enjoy the warmth and feel of a fireplace without the fire! These convenient log sets can be placed anywhere in the home, since they don’t require an outside duct or chimney to operate. Bring your hearth to life with our beautiful hand painted logs and the heat from our powerful gas log chassis. These economical, efficient fireplace systems are the perfect heating solution for your family’s home!Product Features•33,000 Maximum BTU heats up to 1,300 square feet of living space•Unit operates off Liquid Propane Gas Only•Manual on/off control•8 hand painted realistic ceramic fiber logs•Ember Burner chassis design provides one row of flames and a glowing ember bed to create a realistic fire•Solid, black powder coated chassis has a large glowing ember bed appearance and gives a more lifelike look•Economical: 99.9% efficient. No outside duct or chimney needed!•Safety Assurance: SAFETY PILOT O.D.S. (Oxygen Depletion Sensor) included with automatic shut-off•Battery Assisted Piezo ignition (Requires 1 AAA Battery - Included)•PFS Approved•1 bag of glowing ember material includedSpecifications•Must be installed in a masonry or agency approved firebox•Minimum Firebox Size Required: 20” H x 28” W in front (23” W at rear) x 15” D•Safety Assured ANSI Certified System•Designed for Indoor Use OnlyWhat's In the Box:•U-Burner Chassis - Qty. 1Hand Painted Ceramic Logs - Qty. 8•Bag of Embers - Qty. 1•Hardware Pack - Qty. 1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s5q36V3rL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duluth Forge","source_asin":"B07XSQ6RFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XSQ6RFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XSQ6RFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
