window.products.push({"id":936706,"name":"PARACITY 68oz Thermal Coffee Carafe with Ceramic Liner, Vacuum Insulated Coffee Thermos Stainless Steel, Coffee Carafes for Keeping Hot Coffee& Tea fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zWIo3+WqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ceramic Liner Coffee Carafe】Unlike stainless steel thermal coffee carafe, our coffee thermos liner is made of high quality ceramic. Healthier. Ceramics are inorganic materials, rich in natural iron and various trace elements such as zinc and calcium. Beneficial to human health. Better thermal insulation. The thermal conductivity of ceramics is slow, which can lock the temperature more easily. Better taste.Ceramic has strong acid and alkali resistance and corrosion resistance, which can better lock the original taste of coffee. Dishwasher safe. 【Multi-Iayer Vacuum Insulation】Our coffee carafe feature multi-layer vacuum insulation technology for maximum temperature retention.Keeps your coffee/tea hot for up to 12 hours and cold up to 24 hours.The thermal insulation of the ceramic liner thermal coffee carafe is better than that of the stainless steel liner thermos. 【Large capacity coffee carafe】Our thermal coffee carafe has a capacity of 68oz, enough to hold 12 cups of 6oz coffee. The large capacity coffee carafe is perfect for daily use at home, parties, cafes, sports games, conferences, road trips. Unlike other thermal carafe, our insulated coffee carafe are designed with a pearly surface, which is not high-profile and unique. 【Unique Design】The surface of our coffee carafe body is designed with a pearlescent surface, which will emit a dazzling light when the sun shines on the body in winter. The design of the dustproof thermos spout has been upgraded to effectively prevent dust in the air from falling into the nozzle of insulated coffee carafe. 【Easy to use coffee carafe】One button to open, easy to dump with one hand. Perfect for hot tea, cold milk, juice and mulled wine. Our coffee dispenser are specially designed with a non-slip bottom, which makes the coffee thermos very stable when placed on the table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zWIo3+WqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PARACITY","source_asin":"B0BKRH6GDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKRH6GDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKRH6GDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
