window.products.push({"id":936864,"name":"Roundabouts Cupcake Sleeves Popcorn Tub Cupcake Sleeve (Pack of 24)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K06GSAYcL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make unforgettable Popcorn Tub cupcakes instantly without special baking or decorating skills. Simply wrap your pre-baked cupcakes with Roundabouts self-adhesive sleeves, top with carmeled corn or mini marshmallows and go. The sleeve does all the work and you get all the credit. These special adhesive sleeves hold tight even in moist, refrigerated air and are manufactured using solvent-free inks, so designs won't bleed with food oils and grease. Best of all, these patented sleeves are grease resistant, which means frosting mistakes wipe right off! These are not your typical paper cupcake wrappers which sit loosely around a cupcake – Roundabouts sleeves transform cupcakes into a dramatic cylinder shape and turn your plain cupcakes into one-of-a-kind works of art. Fits standard-sized cupcakes (or wrap tighter for mini's). A real winner for movie night, theme parties, or spontaneous after-dinner fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K06GSAYcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roundabouts Cupcake Sleeves","source_asin":"B00AGSOPDE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AGSOPDE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AGSOPDE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
