window.products.push({"id":936894,"name":"Electime Digital Alarm Clock Wooden Clock LED Time Display 3 Alarm Settings Humidity & Temperature Detect with USB Charger Electric Clocks for Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f391xpJJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Dual plus Alarm Setting】Updated in 2020 from dual alarms to three alarms. You can either set two or three alarms to better WAKE you up. One for you and the other for your families. Forever Say no to delay. Also, it allows you to set weekday mode, which will ring only on Monday to Friday. 【3 Brightness Level Adjustable】Allows you to adjust from low to high brightness, or even turn off the LED light and keep it sound sensitive. It’s user friendly at night, which won’t be too harsh for your eyes. 【Sleek Design Desk Clock】Made with the wooden material, a bit different than your basic/standard digital clock, it's also a decorative wooden block fitted into your decors very nicely. Elegant looking and multiple functions make it suitable as a gifts for teens/ kids/friends or families. 【Humidity & Temperatures Sound Control Display】① Sound control is very easy to set it to ON or OFF by following instructions. If you need to know the time but the LED is not always on, you can clap or touch the clock to see the time, really good to people does need unwanted light in a dark room. ② Relative humidity and temperature for indoor is a nice additional feature that does not typically come with standard alarm clock. Just like companion to care your health. [Warranty] Charging with USB power cord (complimentary) We offer a 12 month money back and replacement guarantee from the date of purchase. If you have any problems with your product, please feel free to contact the Electime team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f391xpJJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Electime","source_asin":"B08L3K4FW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L3K4FW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L3K4FW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":936895,"name":"Home-X Clear Acrylic Mug Holder Tree, Coffee Mug Organizer Stand for Countertop, Cup Display, Kitchen Mug Rack, 12\" L x 6\" W x 6\" H, Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619tP5A1bJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are your kitchen cabinets overflowing with mugs and glasses? If you're looking for a quick, easy storage solution that won't take up a lot of space, this coffee mug holder stand is a perfect solution to crowded cabinets. Display all your favorite colorful mugs where everyone can appreciate them and have them right in reach when you're ready for a morning pick-me-up. This acrylic coffee mug holder is a cute addition to any breakfast nook or break room setup, and it's entirely washable, so there's no need to worry about mold from moisture. Hand wash with mild soap. It can also be used as a holder for jewelry and hair ties or even as a key stand in the hallway. Wherever you put it, the space-saving acrylic tree stand is a great way to stay organized. Each clear plastic coffee mug rack is made of BPA-free plastic. The hard, clear branches are easy to install into the flat, solid base—it takes only minutes. Each acrylic tree stand is 12\" L x 6\" W x 6\" H, perfectly sized to fit on your kitchen countertop without looking out of place or taking up too much room. For a creative holiday idea, gift this coffee mug stand to anyone you know who loves coffee or tea. Pair it with their favorite flavor of tea, coffee, or hot cocoa along with a beautiful mug they'll treasure. Or help a new homeowner organize their kitchen with this thoughtful housewarming present. Having family over for the holidays? Set up a cozy coffee nook with a special mug for everyone and enjoy your mornings more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619tP5A1bJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08L4L9VZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L4L9VZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L4L9VZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":936896,"name":"PierSurplus CL221889 Moroccan-style Metal Candle Lantern, 19.25 in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d2Ry28IcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of mystery and worldliness to any evening's entertainment! This metal candle lantern has been finished in dark patina and has been designed for indoor or outdoor use. Hang it outside from the top hook, or use it as a table centerpiece at a wedding. Inspired by Moroccan art, it adds a romantic, worldly touch to any special occasion. Its decorative design encases candles to burn safely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d2Ry28IcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PierSurplus","source_asin":"B008BS16TM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008BS16TM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008BS16TM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
