window.products.push({"id":936936,"name":"Kardiel Corona Style Chair & Stool, Black Aniline Leather","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oxd3eim5L._AC_SL1320_.jpg","description":"Poul M. Volther created the original Corona Chair in 1962. Kardiel specializes in this series and understands fully the intricacies of the original design. Like the original, this reproduction of the Corona Chair is fully handcrafted using the finest materials such as premium aniline leather and pure stainless steel legs. This stunning reproduction not only has the unmistakable look of Poul M. Volther, its as close as it can be to the original design. * 100% Genuine Top Grain Premium Soft Aniline Leather * Smooth Contour pressed high density CA-117 foam & Dacron wrap provides meticulous shape contour & Cushion Platform resilience. * Entire Chair and Ottoman hand sewn using braid Lockstitch (stitch type #301) providing the look and durability of the original seams * Pure solid Stainless Steel #304 Flat Bar 3/8” thick x 1 ½” frame with a 3 step hand polished shine * Constructed around a Steel “dimension true” curvature shell. * Pre-inserted steel body bolt sleeves keep the frames stainless steel hexagon bolts tightly secured to the shell without stripping * Ottoman is stationary. The Chair features a steel bearing swivel base for smooth level turning. * Pre-attached floor protective pads on the feet of the chair, as well as the feet on the ottoman. * True to original Width and length Cushion Platform units: * Top Oval Shell Platform- 25\" Wide x 7\" High * 2nd Oval Shell Platform- 29\" Wide x 8\" High * 3rd Oval Shell Platform- 32\" Wide x 11\" High * Seat Oval Shell Platform-34\" Wide x 18.5\" Deep * The top, second, and third Oval Shell Platforms are all approximately 2.5\" in thickness. The seat cushion Platform is approximately 4\" in thickness. * True to original, distance between each Oval Shell Platform is approximately 1.25\" with a sitting back tilt of 10 degrees. * Chair Dimension: Width 33.9″ x Depth 32.1″ x Height 39″ * Ottoman Dimension: Width 29.1″ x Depth 16.9″ x Height 18.5″ * Some assembly required. The chair comes in 3 separate boxes: The 1st box contains the chair body. The 2nd has the base with 4 bolts and an Allen Wrench Tool for fastening the base to the seat platform. The 3rd box is the ottoman completely assembled. * This Chair is not manufactured by Carl Hansen. Kardiel has no affiliation with Carl Hansen. It's a fact. Only 5% of the world's leather is of high enough quality to earn the grade \"Top Grain European Aniline Soft Leather\". Although limited in production, the original Hans J Wegner Chairs used it and so does the Kardiel reproduction. Top Grain European Aniline Soft Leather does not require imitation grain stamping & poly pigment top coatings. Like the original, the Kardiel chair has a natural rich luster, not the dull plasticized leather worn by 95% of the others. Premium Top Grain Aniline Leather is used on this reproduction. Learn more about the leather difference below: 100% Genuine Top Grain Premium Soft Aniline Leather Split Grain Leather. On a very basic level, leather furniture consists of Split grain or Top Grain. Split Grain is the leather type used on mid price reproduction furniture and is sold in the U.S and Canada as 100% Genuine, Italian or European leather. Split Grain is the underside of the hide that has been separated from the surface or “top” of the hide. While genuine leather, Split Grain leather does not have the natural surface grain of the cowhide. A topical layer of insoluble pigment is applied to the surface of split grain leather, which is then stamped or “grain embossed” to imitate the surface appearance of actual Top Grain leather. By law, in the U.K and Australia split grain can no longer be sold as 100% leather as the surface area is not the natural grain but insoluble pigment. 100% will often accompany the description of the leather meaning 100% of the furniture's surface (back, sides, cushions) are covered in split grain leather. Top Grain Aniline European leather. One of Kardiel's Quality Differences. This item is upholstered in premium Top Grain Aniline European leather. Top Grain is the actual surface of the cowhide. While no one knows the actual number, a small percentage of furniture sold today is upholstered in Premium Top Grain Aniline leather. Some claim as low as 5%. Aniline dying describes one of the two processes in which color is applied to the leather with the dye penetrating the leather and extending beyond the surface, into the leather itself. For modern furniture requiring a clean aesthetic, Top Grain Aniline Leather is both “liquid vat” (deep penetrating) and surface dyed to achieve the main color selection and to conceal uneven tones and blemishes in the hide. Top grain aniline is the softest leather and naturally breaths well. Because Top Grain refers to the actual surface of the animal hide it presents a natural leather appearance you would expect. While it is true that raw Top Grain Aniline absorbs spills easier, Furniture grade Top Grain leather features a stain resistant treatment making it exceptional for everyday lower maintenan","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oxd3eim5L._AC_SL1320_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kardiel","source_asin":"B00VQ7SONQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VQ7SONQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VQ7SONQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
