window.products.push({"id":936965,"name":"fancy-fix Vinyl Raindrop Decorative Window Glass Film 35.4 Inches by 59 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yLAtB1MnL._AC_SL1491_.jpg","description":"Want to decorate your windows while still allowing light to come into the room? If so, you'll love our Raindrop Glass Decorative Window Film! This ultra smooth film features a delicate raindrop design for added style and is incredibly easy to install. All you have to do is measure your window or door, cut the film to the appropriate size using a utility knife or scissors and then gently apply it to the clean glass surface using a squeegee. What Included: 1 roll 35.4-inch by 59-inch window film 1 PIECE step by step Window Film Installation Instruction  Our unique raindrop film comes in two sizes. Choose from a 35.4¡n x 59¡n roll and then click ' Add to Cart ' to place your order today! Quick Tips: Step 01. Clean glass Step 02.Wet glass with soapy water(or just clear water also work well) Step 03. Remove from backing protect sheet (which is a kind of clear vinyl, please MAKE SURE remove it before you apply the window film to glass) Step 04. Apply to wet glass and smooth with hands Step 05. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Removal and Storage for Re-use To remove, simply peel the window film from any corner. It comes off cleanly leaving no residue. When not in use, window film must be replaced and stored on the original backing paper. The side of the film that touched the glass should face the glossy side of the backing paper. About fancy-fix Fancy-fix team has been in printing production line for more than 20 years. We perseveres with its unchanged idea since the first day of its birth, devoting our life to developing self-adhesive & adhesive free products in homing trend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yLAtB1MnL._AC_SL1491_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fancy-fix","source_asin":"B00U7JYJDI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U7JYJDI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U7JYJDI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
