window.products.push({"id":936978,"name":"NETANY 16-Piece Forks and Spoons Silverware Set, 8 Dinner Forks and 8 Dinner Spoons, 18/8 Stainless Steel Flatware Cutlery Set, Mirror Polished, Dishw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rII9hN50L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT AS A MISSING REPLACEMENT: 16 pieces of forks and spoons and each of 8 in this pack, enough for replenishing the silverware sets if the forks and spoons go missing all the time. No need to purchase a complete set and have some extra forks and spoons as a preparation against a rainy day. 18/8 STAINLESS STEEL: All forks and spoons are made of premium food-grade 18/8 stainless steel, rust and corrosion resistant, sturdy and durable with solid made making it last for long term. Healthy and safe better than some metal utensils with coating and painting, no BPA, no lead. DISHWASHER SAFE. COMFORTABLE, ELEGANT DESIGN: The forks and spoons are designed with many ergonomic details from the handle to the prongs, mirror polished of the surface and smooth edges with no burrs. They are all in the right size and suitable weight, very handy to grip and hold. Classic shape and stunning looking make all the flatware elegant and fancy on your table. MATCHES WELL WITH YOUR FLATWARE: The classy appearance of these forks and spoons fits perfectly with your existing silverware set, without complicated patterns and colors, the simple but sleek shape design is perfect for any style of tableware. Not only a good choice as a replacement but also great for a good table setting. MULTIPLE USES: As the most commonly used flatware on daily and party, having more forks and spoons are always a smart decision, not just make up a complete silverware set for your table setups, but also versatile for many meals eating like spaghetti, thick soup, ice cream, oatmeal, yogurt, pudding, and even casseroles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rII9hN50L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NETANY","source_asin":"B09FPWHLRM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FPWHLRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FPWHLRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":936979,"name":"The Goddess On The Go Glass Infuser Water Bottle - Luxury Packaging - BPA Free Double Wall Glass Travel Mug with Natural Bamboo Lid - Leakproof Tea Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RKx-xL5hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How do you stay healthy when you’re always on-the-go? So much to do, so little time. In this age of opportunity, that has become your mantra. You work in the office, meet clients in cafes, finish a report on the plane. Errands, household chores, PTA meetings are mainstays in your to-do list. In short, you live on your feet. To be fair, you do take care of yourself with exercise and enough sleep. But diet remains your biggest challenge. How do you eat and drink right when you’re constantly on the move, and with fast food being your only option? The Goddess On The Go Tumbler With Stainless Steel Infuser helps you drink healthy on the go. Now, you can have your tea and drink it, too, anytime and anywhere. Infuse hot water with tea straight into the tumbler. Catch the leaves using the stainless steel strainer that comes with it. Put the tumbler in your bag, or carry it with the loop handle, and head out of the house. Tea is your health's best friend. It contains antioxidants that fight aging and environmental toxins. It also supports digestion. But if you’re the cold drink type, infuse fruits or vegetables instead. This versatile tumbler is made of glass, so it can handle the thermal shock. And it’s better than plastic as it doesn’t leach in extreme temperatures. Here are more reasons to love The Goddess On The Go Tumbler With Stainless Steel Infuser: ✔ BPA and lead-free ✔ Naturally harvested bamboo lid and neoprene travel sleeve; food grade silicone seal and stainless steel infuser/strainer ✔ Heat resistant, spill-proof, and easy to clean ✔ Elegantly designed and wrapped in sophisticated packaging. Perfect gift idea for your favorite goddess. ✔ Reusable. Never throw another plastic cup into the landfill again. Stay active and drink healthy with The Goddess On The Go Tumbler With Stainless Steel Infuser. Add it to your cart now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RKx-xL5hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORI ULTD","source_asin":"B07HQ6WH2B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HQ6WH2B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HQ6WH2B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
