window.products.push({"id":936992,"name":"DYZQ Weighted Blanket (60 x 80, 20 lbs for 150-200) Yellow Removable Cover with 100% Cotton Material and Glass Beads 2.0 Heavy Blankets Set for Adults","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618N4r7woOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Weighted blankets and removable cover are engineered to be 7-12% of your body weight . A well sleep method that help sleep and relax mood. How Does A Weighted Blanket Work? A weighted blanket is a heavy blanket that provides gentle, like a whole-body hug. You can cover the whole body for sleep and snuggle the sofa for watching TV.The weighted blanket to comfort anytime your body. How to clean: By simply removing the cover and washing the duvet cover, your blanket will be less prone to deterioration from rigorous washing cycles. Small pocket: Heavy Glass Beads are evenly distributed and compartmentalized inside the blanket to provide an even weight distribution that will not shift. The inner blanket is made with silky soft microfiber fabric. Use Notes： 1. when using with children or seniors, ensure the individual has enough strength to move the blanket off themselves if necessary.2. Weighted Blankets should never go past the shoulders or cover the head. 3.The Cover is washable on a gentle setting,but dry clean or hand-wash is better.4.Check for damage of the blanket regularly to prevent the inner stuff leak out. Service: If for any reason you are not happy with your purchase, we will refund your order no questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618N4r7woOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DYZQ","source_asin":"B07GND77ZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GND77ZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GND77ZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":936993,"name":"P'Kolino Children's Chair, Zigzag Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LaJrxtEJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy Maintenance: Machine washable cover. Thanks to the wide-base, angular construction and premium materials the Little Reader does not topple over like many lower quality foam chairs. Ergonomically perfected. Just the right size to give the proper support for little ones, with wider contoured seat and arm rests. 100% High Density foam has the perfect balance of softness and support (like a premium mattress). No lumpy stuffing, no uncomfortable wood frames or springs. Just 100% comfort. Furniture grade (not T-shirt grade) cover is made from premium micro-suede. The cover has reinforced seems for added durability. Feathery light and has a handle so your little one can tote this chair to their favorite spot. Quiet time, to story time, to movie time and back again! Handle for carrying and large side, easy-access pocket for books and other favorites.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LaJrxtEJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P'Kolino","source_asin":"B0148ZSVFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-936993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0148ZSVFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0148ZSVFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
